e place feels familiar instead of difficult. Jon leaves a busy cafe with no illusion that every future difficulty will be simple. Still, the experience provides a durable lesson: thoughtful decisions grow from evidence, conversation, and the courage to revise an attractive idea.$story$, 'en', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PLATFORM', 'A1', 'Work'),
